{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18105512","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18105512","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1810551201:0":{"text":"这样便好了。希尔达，你身上已经不疼了，放松些……","source_cn":"这样便好了。希尔达，你身上已经不疼了，放松些……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71B3F60F481C867E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810551202:0":{"text":"“希尔达”仍然喘着粗气。不知是不是因为灵魂与躯体的不匹配，她的反应总是有些迟钝。","source_cn":"“希尔达”仍然喘着粗气。不知是不是因为灵魂与躯体的不匹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89D6673BD638E25E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810551203:0":{"text":"仿佛想要安抚她一样，穆婆婆再次哼起那首歌谣，又伸出左手放在她的左肩上——如果那树枝能算作希尔达肩膀的话——轻轻地、有节奏地拍打着。","source_cn":"仿佛想要安抚她一样，穆婆婆再次哼起那首歌谣，又伸出左手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58DCFBD70681073","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810551204:0":{"text":"温柔哼唱声里，你注意到了瑟恩和里纳的视线。它们不约而同地落在了穆婆婆的那只手上。","source_cn":"温柔哼唱声里，你注意到了瑟恩和里纳的视线。它们不约而同...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x02E3546CAF35D959","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"温柔哼唱声里，你注意到了瑟恩和里纳的视线。它们不约而同地落在了穆婆婆的那只手上。","female":"温柔哼唱声里，你注意到了瑟恩和里纳的视线。它们不约而同地落在了穆婆婆的那只手上。","variant_male_record_index":"243761","variant_female_record_index":"243762","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810551205:0":{"text":"婆婆安慰人的时候，总是喜欢用左手拍别人的左肩……我一直觉得这动作有种熟悉的感觉。","source_cn":"婆婆安慰人的时候，总是喜欢用左手拍别人的左肩……我一直...","